<title>USA: TABLE - CryoLife Inc Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - CryoLife Inc Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.12		    $0.10</p>
<p> Net			  1,160			988</p>
<p> Revs			12,724		    9,698</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   9,888		    9,933</p>
<p>	  SIX MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.21		    $0.18</p>
<p> Net			  2,112		    1,771</p>
<p> Revs			23,136		   18,132</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   9,882		    9,876</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Company said Q2 1997 includes a one-time charge of $110,000 associated with its acquisition of Ideas for Medicine Inc.</p>
<p>It said improved revenues for Q2 1997 reflect market acceptance and surgical applications of cryopreserved human tissues for transplant.</p>
